		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>taking alive</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωγρίῃ
