				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					700.30
				</span></i>
			 (Macedonia, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωγρία ἐγκρατὴς</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύριος
